# Build output
/target
/dist
**/*.rs.bk

# Private working notes: operator/developer-local, never published. `internal/`
# holds review knowledge and open decision logs; `test.md` is a local
# pre-publication checklist. ADR-016 keeps both out of the public tree, and
# scripts/clean-export.sh excludes them from the export as well.
internal/
/test.md

